flowchart TD
    A[Remote refs and detached audited tip] --> B[Baseline gates and named inventory]
    B --> C{All benchmark surfaces build?}
    C -->|No: stale benchmarks lock| D[Record baseline defect]
    C -->|Yes| E[Smoke inventory]
    D --> F[Source ownership and duplication map]
    E --> F
    F --> G[Facade, rank-2 and Levi semantic reconstruction]
    G --> H[Metric timing-boundary and comparability table]
    H --> I[Independent repro A and repro B]
    I --> J[Allocation, RSS and CPU-scaling decomposition]
    J --> K{Qualifying defect or measured regression?}
    K -->|No| L[No production edit]
    K -->|Yes| M[Failing test or discriminating benchmark]
    M --> N[Smallest corrective edit]
    N --> O[Full affected gates and before/after]
    L --> P[Audit TSVs, report and ownership map]
    O --> P
    P --> Q[Verify refs, clean worktree and push audit branch]
    Q --> R[HARD STOP]

    IR[hymeko_core::ir::Ir] --> IDX[IncidenceIndex borrowed derived index]
    IDX --> MAT[MatroidRef one-reference facade]
    MAT --> R2[Rank-2 operations]
    MAT --> LEVI[Implicit Levi operations]
    R2 --> WS[Shared caller-owned DSU workspace]
    LEVI --> WS
    CTRL[Benchmark-only star and clique controls] -. never production authority .-> H
